Z||000000||Jake_Dragon||01-29-2001||09:00 PM||||OK I find me an 85 black beauty, its not perfect but seemed to run that is till I pay for it.<BR>Hand over the cash and drive home to pickup my wife and it died in the driveway.<BR>Now the first thing I think is its out of fuel, I run down and get some gas and still now go, it will start and is getting spark but as soon as I give it some gas it dies. Thinking I have a plugged filter I run and get one.<BR>Still no go and I am not a happy camper. If you have any ideas please help.  <BR>||||reg||8
