Z||000009||88formula||01-30-2001||09:07 PM||||How much fuel pressure? You should have 9-13 lbs. of pressure. Watching the fuel pump into a bucket is not an indication of fuel pressure.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
